%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen... can I get some of that rice?\d%K%P
「那…我能吃饭么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSure!\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
That, on its own, seemed to instantly dispel Mitoko's bad\nmood, and she reached out to the rice cooker right away.%K%P
仅仅是我这一句简简单单的话，\n美都子的坏心情便被瞬间赶跑，\n然后我就看见一双欢快手直直了伸向电饭锅。%K%P
Good... Seemed like playing it safe would let me live\nthrough another day.%K%P
好…今天也精妙地做出了没有问题的选择，我太机智了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWimp.\d%K%P
「弱…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI think lamb meat and rice still go together pretty\nwell.\d%K%P
「羊羔肉和饭十分合适…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI bet it's healthier to just eat the way you like.\d%K%P
「明明享受美食对身体才好的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're an adult, Ms. Kaya. You should know not to tease\nher too much.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐你是大人了，还是收敛一点吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIf you can say that loud enough for the landlord to hear,\nI'll stop.\d%K%P
「如果这话是房东小姐说的，\n我倒是可以退出」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'll be repeating myself, but could you please cut that\nout?\d%K%P
「虽然都说过很多次了，但今天还是饶了我吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere you go, Mr. Laid-off. Eat it all, so you have enough\nstrength for your job hunting tomorrow!\d%K%P
「给，失业先生。\n今天多吃点，明天也要努力找工作！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry, could we make it one quarter of that?\d%K%P
「…抱歉。\n能减少到四分之一么？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEeh?!\d%K%P
「诶～？」%K%P
It looked as though she figured a single bowl wouldn't be\nenough, so she put another one on top of it. I'd never\neven seen a rice portion that big.%K%P
只见那里放着两碗饭，其中一个完全被饭盖上，\n就像画里描绘的那样，米饭已经堆成了山。%K%P
